<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard Access Verification</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background-color: #1a1b26; color: #a9b1d6; margin: 0; display: flex; height: 100vh; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .login-card { background-color: #24283b; border: 1px solid #2f3549; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); max-width: 400px; width: 100%; }
        h1 { color: #7aa2f7; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { color: #565f89; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .btn-discord { background-color: #5865F2; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; transition: background 0.2s; border: none; font-size: 1rem; width: 85%; }
        .btn-discord:hover { background-color: #4752C4; }
        .error-banner { background-color: rgba(247, 118, 142, 0.15); border: 1px solid #f7768e; color: #f7768e; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: left; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-card">
        <h1>🔒 Administrative Clearance</h1>
        <p>Verification is required to modify system configuration registries.</p>
        
        <% if (error) { %>
            <div class="error-banner">
                <strong>Access Blocked:</strong> <%= error %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <a href="/auth/discord" class="btn-discord">Log In with Discord</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>